    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "those conditions are binding on the company" -- the subsection speaks of the conditions on which the Registrar grants approval

DECLARE `s 29(3) act` IS ONE OF
    `s 29(3) insert the conditions in the constitution of the company`

-- The insertion duty: "must, if the Registrar so directs, be inserted in the constitution". No time is fixed, so no trace reaches BREACH.
-- src:5184 | (3) The Registrar may grant his or her approval on such conditions
-- src:5185 | as the Registrar thinks fit, and those conditions are binding on the
-- src:5186 | company and must, if the Registrar so directs, be inserted in the
