@ref s 29A(5) (src:5342-5347)
GIVEN `the Registrar is satisfied that the company, registered with the omission of the word Limited or Berhad under section 29A, has ceased to be a charitable company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `notice of that fact has been given to the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 29A(5) the exemption under subsection (4)(b) has ceased` MEANS
